

1. Introduction
ANSWER:
This agreement is made on the 23rd day of February, 2022, in Alexanderborough, Jordan, between Alexander Financial Group (hereinafter referred to as the "Lender") and Kristyside Enterprises Inc (hereinafter referred to as the "Borrower"). The Lender agrees to lend a sum of money to the Borrower for the purpose of capital expenditure for the expansion of a manufacturing plant. The parties have agreed to the terms and conditions set forth herein.

2. Preamble
The Lender and the Borrower have entered into this agreement in light of the following:

(a) The Borrower requires a loan to finance the capital expenditure for the expansion of a manufacturing plant;

(b) The Lender is willing to lend the funds necessary for the Borrower's purposes;

(c) The parties have agreed to the terms and conditions set forth in this agreement;

(d) This agreement is entered into on the 23rd day of February, 2022, in Alexanderborough, Jordan.

3. Parties
(a) The Lender: Alexander Financial Group, a corporation duly organized and existing under the laws of [Jurisdiction], having its principal place of business at [Lender's address].

(b) The Borrower: Kristyside Enterprises Inc, a corporation duly organized and existing under the laws of [Jurisdiction], having its principal place of business at [Borrower's address].

The Lender and the Borrower are the parties to this agreement. The Lender is lending the funds to the Borrower, and the Borrower is borrowing the funds from the Lender.

4. Definitions
(a) "Agreement" means this Loan Agreement, dated as of the Agreement Date, between the Lender and the Borrower.

(b) "Agreement Date" means February 23, 2022.

(c) "Borrower" means Kristyside Enterprises Inc, a corporation duly organized and existing under the laws of [Jurisdiction], having its principal place of business at [Borrower's address].

(d) "Lender" means Alexander Financial Group, a corporation duly organized and existing under the laws of [Jurisdiction], having its principal place of business at [Lender's address].

(e) "Interest Rate" means the annual interest rate of 12% on the Outstanding Principal Amount.

(f) "Outstanding Principal Amount" means the total amount of the Loan that remains unpaid, including any accrued and unpaid interest, at any given time.

(g) "Loan" means the loan made by the Lender to the Borrower for the purpose of capital expenditure for the expansion of a manufacturing plant, in accordance with the terms and conditions of this Agreement.

(h) "Repayment Terms" means monthly repayments for 5 years, with a grace period of 3 months.

5. Representations and Warranties
(a) The Lender represents and warrants to the Borrower that:

    (i) It has the full right, power, and authority to enter into this Agreement and to perform its obligations hereunder.

    (ii) This Agreement has been duly executed and delivered by it and, assuming the due authorization, execution, and delivery by the Borrower, constitutes a legal, valid, and binding obligation of it, enforceable against it in accordance with its terms, except as enforcement may be limited by applicable bankruptcy, insolvency, reorganization, moratorium, or similar laws affecting creditors' rights generally.

    (iii) The execution, delivery, and performance of this Agreement by the Lender do not and will not violate any agreement to which it is a party or by which it is bound, or any law, rule, regulation, order, judgment, or decree applicable to it.

(b) The Borrower represents and warrants to the Lender that:

    (i) It has the full right, power, and authority to enter into this Agreement and to perform its obligations hereunder.

    (ii) This Agreement has been duly executed and delivered by it and, assuming the due authorization, execution, and delivery by the Lender, constitutes a legal, valid, and binding obligation of it, enforceable against it in accordance with its terms, except as enforcement may be limited by applicable bankruptcy, insolvency, reorganization, moratorium, or similar laws affecting creditors' rights generally.

    (iii) The information provided in this Agreement, including but not limited to the Loan Purpose, is true, accurate, and complete in all material respects as of the date hereof.

